# Local agent state. .claude/worktrees/ holds untracked git worktrees whose
# vendored manifests carry mutable :latest image references; uploading them
# trips cloudbuild.yaml's reject-mutable-images guard on a local
# `gcloud builds submit`. A CI checkout has no untracked files, so this only
# bites local deploys -- but it bites them every time.
